''}+2x{y}^{'}={x}^{2}y$\n- **II.** $5{x}^{2}y+3{y}^{5}{y}^{'}=4x$\n- **III.** $\\sqrt{{y}^{2}+{y}^{'}}+7{x}^{3}={e}^{y}$" :question/worked-solution "A differential equation is of first-order if the largest derivative term in the equation is ${y}^{'}.$\n\nKeeping this in mind, let's check each given equation.\n\n- Equation I is not a first-order differential equation. The highest derivative in this equation is ${y}^{''},$ so this is a second-order differential equation.\n\n- Equation II is a first-order differential equation. The highest derivative in this equation is ${y}^{'}.$\n\n- Equation III is also a first-order differential equation. The highest derivative in this equation is ${y}^{'}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186234491 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8d0d894d-c809-5dae-b04c-777fa7f1b329" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422291} {:answer/id #uuid "3ef08266-c8b5-5d86-ba6c-38cec94b0b81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422292}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8d0d894d-c809-5dae-b04c-777fa7f1b329" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422291} :answer-field/id #uuid "34bc34b4-9e03-56ed-af57-5921ddebb2d3" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422426} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ccb30e5b-1e6e-5289-8a92-1d1a6eb3264f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422293} {:answer/id #uuid "5090af3c-f638-5321-a137-c61895760b06" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186422294}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ccb30e5b-1e6e-5289-8a92-1d1a6eb3264f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 1759218